a0a&_nc_ohc=Qu4SzpGCG4QQ7kNvwE4m2ad&_nc_oc=Adl3JO7xtJv2z4V8ez_QZCIk-t27vg6pvwpvau65feqWOquM8LbA2sVePMeMr90uLH8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuY9EyuScYU0OKCzg7dibzBkiPinODgtyjry2LC78eo5g&oe=6999AD7D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "EmatahnCoverHiRes.png", "id": "511241218457028", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57575352_511241221790361_760251907399571310_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4I36UP5faZAQ7kNvwFOdPQR&_nc_oc=AdlB1A-mkzEHXs_KelHc1_3WmAoGDbDcChoHSTad1561QHyPx44oFL0JlmKPgjW0tjI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsQ73S4SnaJ7-Gyugpp-s9XwUnkfsm4yJPg43HBzSxfJQ&oe=6999B512"}, "display_name": "Legend of the Ematahn", "keywords": ["Action", "Adventure", "Physics", "Combat", "Magic"], "long_description": "# Embark on a new adventure!\n\nAs you're beginning to make friends with a nearby village, a new group emerges that threatens the stability of the Highlands. Legend of the Ematahn is an action adventure game featuring physics based combat, magic, an original story, and a world waiting to be explored. Complete quests for the different factions of the Highlands. Uncover a history of conflict and defend the people against threats of all kind. Are you up to the challenge?\n\n# Features\n\n* An original story with 18 unique quests.\n* A physics based combat system with magic.\n* VR climbing and platforming quests.\n* Boss fights.\n* 5 different factions with unique characters and dialog.\n* Survival mode with 6 different maps.\n* More to be added in future updates!", "short_description": "Embark on a new adventure! Legend of the Ematahn is an action adventure game featuring physics based combat, magic, an original story, and a world waiting to be explored. Complete quests for the different factions of the Highlands. Uncover a history of conflict and defend the people against threats of all kind. Are you up to the challenge?"}]}, "developer_name": null,